      "source": "For example, a [`List`](list.md) with a [`ForEach`](foreach.md) that’s configured with the [`onDelete(perform:)`](dynamicviewcontent/ondelete(perform:).md) or [`onMove(perform:)`](dynamicviewcontent/onmove(perform:).md) modifier provides controls to delete or move list items while in edit mode.",
